        "model": "bai/qwen3.8-flash",
        "v": 5,
        "title": "Add CLI install copy analytics event",
        "summary": "Added `FREEBUFF_CLI_INSTALL_COMMAND_COPIED` enum value to `AnalyticsEvent` in `common/src/constants/analytics-events.ts`. Tracks when users copy the install command on the CLI landing page (`/cli`). Distinguishes hero vs install section via `location` property and serves as a proxy for install intent since CLI activation lacks direct web identity linkage.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-14T15:52:35.960Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "When you're on the CLI installation page and copy the install command, the system now records that action. This helps track how often people intend to install the CLI, especially to see which marketing links or campaigns are working. The tracking also notes whether the copy happened from the main banner or the install section lower on the page.",
