      "facts": [
        "Freebuff - Cloud landing page (/cloud). Fired when a logged-out visitor clicks a \"Continue with GitHub\" / \"Connect your repo\" CTA; `location` distinguishes hero vs the migration/lovable section vs the final CTA. Best proxy for cloud sign-up intent (utm_* ride along as super-properties).",
        "Whether the model is still being trialed and may be unreliable. Surfaced in the picker as a \"TEST\" badge with a tooltip so users know it is not yet production-grade."
      ],
      "title": "Shared/Core update: analytics-events",
      "summary": "Shared/Core changes across 2 file(s) (+39/−50).",
